# Thumby Battlefield

A retro game for the **Thumby**—the miniature playable keychain arcade console. 

![Thumby Console](https://tinycircuits.com/cdn/shop/products/clearthumby1065x1065-min.jpg)

### 🎮 How to Play

Give it a play directly in your browser:
**[Play Thumby Battlefield Live](https://chain-linc.github.io/Cresent-Retro/)**

---

### Controls

* **WASD (Up/Down/Left/Right):** Move your character/crosshair across the battlefield.
* **. (period) Button (A Button):** Primary Action / Shoot.
* **, (period) (B button):** Secondary Action / Select.
